    {
      "flavor_text": "てっきゅうの　ような　かせきから\nふっかつした　こだいの　ポケモン。\nずつきで　えものを　しとめた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "철구 같은 화석에서\n부활한 고대 포켓몬이다.\n박치기로 먹이를 꼼짝 못하게 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On l’a ressuscité à partir d’un fossile de fer en forme\nde balle. Il abat ses proies à coups de tête.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wurde aus einem ballartigen, eisernen Fossil\ngeschaffen. Es schlägt Beute mit einem Kopfstoß.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fue recreado a partir de un fósil con forma esférica.\nDerriba a las presas a cabezazos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È stato fatto rivivere da un fossile di ferro simile a\nuna palla. Abbatte le prede con le punte sulla testa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It was resurrected from an iron ball-like fossil.\nIt downs prey with its headbutts.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "鉄球の　ような　化石から\n復活した　古代の　ポケモン。\n頭突きで　獲物を　しとめた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fue recreado a partir de un fósil con forma esférica.\nDerriba a las presas a cabezazos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
